OL,3,GNEWSABoy's body pulled from river in
OL,4,ADumfries after he collapsed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe body of a teenage boy has been
OL,7,Fpulled from a river in Dumfries.
OL,9,FKenzie Carmichael, 16, was found in the
OL,10,FRiver Nith near the Boathouse on Nith
OL,11,FAvenue following reports that he had
OL,12,Fcollapsed at 19:35 on Wednesday.
OL,14,FPolice said emergency services attended
OL,15,Fand he was pulled from the water but
OL,16,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FDet Insp Scott Wilson said his family
OL,19,Fand friends were devastated. Police do
OL,20,Fnot believe the incident is suspicious
OL,21,Fand have appealed for information.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
